The hand-written net reproduces the tables exactly (EVAL matches my own forward pass), but compressing to groups loses accuracy, so I am replacing tables with one value path using tent kinks (4 neurons for circular distance, 2 for plain distance), after searching more level counts per skill. Expect training accuracy to rise to each form's fit.
